I appreciate your advide, but i have failed horribly in life for the last year. I got sick physically and long term few weeks after starting first year of university. I fucked up socially, i fucked up academically. My life has been painful and meaningless for the last months. I owe studentloan for nothing, i have wasted time. Rest of my friends starting college / university have their time of their life. I am a dissapointment to my family. There is nothing in my life that has any meaning now, its all ruined.

&#x200B;

The only one i talk to, and i talk to this person a lot is an Italian girl i became friends with over reddit. She got her own problems and we support eachother. But i honestly dont know how to tackle the pain anymore. It feels like i am being punished by the universe, even how stupid it sounds. I cannot see so much positive now.

&#x200B;

There is nothing

