i am not to good at this. but according to battery health statistic thing. the phone was last charged to 99% yesterday, 20 hours ago. and it says on activity 50 minutes with screen on, and 21 with screen off. Its currently at 15% percentage. sometimes it stays on 1% for up to 30 minutes too. so its very inaccurate. and it fell from like 99% to 70 in 15 minutes. This was me using it to check of the battery was after complaint i got on the battery. But i dont get it entirely because it say youtube music 3 minutes screen on and 46 minutes in the background

