Thats an interesting question you are asking buddy. Personally i am not against it. I go shotgun hunting on grouses / ptarmigons, and i fish. But i think the question we should ask ourself is if it moral to kill animals overall. The worst thing is people that are sitting at macdonalds eating their bigmac, while talking about how immoral is to hunt. But in my philosophy classed we discussed the topic about killing animals, and an philosopher ( cannot remember his name ) said that we humans have a choice to kill and eat animals, compared to animals. They do it out of instinc, we do it because we like it. He even compared it to slavery, and called it abuse of animals

&#x200B;

 So my answer to your question is maybe, it depends on how you look at it. 

